A configurable multiplayer drinking game for Slay the Spire 2.

[b]Docs, rules and wiki:[/b] [url=https://dhkatz.github.io/SlayTheSpirits/]dhkatz.github.io/SlayTheSpirits[/url] (how to play, rule sets, every card, relic and potion)

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Penalties for game moments: boss and elite fights, specific enemies, deaths, big hits, curses, potions, wasted energy, rest-site water breaks, winning and losing.
[*][b]Tavern cards[/b] (colorless, plus three per character) that make your friends drink: [i]Cheers![/i], [i]Round on Me[/i], [i]Bottoms Up[/i], [i]Last Call[/i].
[*]Drinks are [b]status cards[/b] (Sip, Shot, Finish Your Drink...) that play automatically, with speech-bubble banter.
[*][b]Rest site tabs[/b]: pick Tavern cards or a [b]Tavern relic[/b] now, and pay later with a [b]Tavern curse[/b] in your deck (Hiccups, Bar Fly, Hangover, Beer Goggles...). Settle up at the Tavern.
[*][b]Tavern events[/b]: the Speakeasy and Seven Grand, two bars in "?" rooms.
[*][b]Tavern potions[/b] that you drink for real: [i]Light Beer[/i], [i]Tallboy[/i], [i]Firewater[/i].
[*][b]Tipsy[/b]: a run-long buff that some cards scale with. A per-combat [b]bar tab[/b] under each player shows what they owe.
[*]Presets (Casual, Standard, Degenerate, Sober), per-act caps that downgrade penalties, custom labels and share codes.
[/list]

[h2]Multiplayer[/h2]
The host's rules are sent to everyone and locked for the run; clients never use their own settings. Every player needs the same version of the mod, and for now the game's [b]public-beta[/b] branch (Steam > Slay the Spire 2 > Properties > Betas). Rules are edited under [b]Settings > Spirits[/b] on the main menu.

[h2]Drink responsibly[/h2]
A party game for adults who choose to drink. [b]Nobody has to drink:[/b] anyone can play with water or soda, and the Sober rule set renames every drink. Know your limit, take the water at rest sites, never drink and drive, and follow the law on drinking age where you are.

